# No test here is small, and none of that is about the tests being slow: on the CI executor image
# they are killed at a small target's 60s with the budget spent fetching inputs rather than running
# -- 70s of `fileDownloadDurationUsec` against 12KB actually fetched and, for two of them, no CPU
# burned at all. <devinfra/debug/2026_08_rbe_small_test_timeouts.md> is the class.

